{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}
{% block title %}Grapevine / LaVina Committee | Area 75{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
<div class="page-title-bar">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="{{ path('app_home') }}">Home</a> › <a href="#">Area Business</a> › <span>Grapevine</span></div>
    <h1>The Area 75 Grapevine / LaViña Committee</h1>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="page-content">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:860px;">

    <div class="content-section">
      <p>The Area 75 Grapevine/LaViña Committee is a place where those with an interest in the A.A. Grapevine — the International Journal of Alcoholics Anonymous — hear news about the Grapevine magazine and its books and other products. We share experience, strength, and hope with regard to our own use of the Grapevine in our recoveries, in our group life, and in our service to A.A.</p>
      <p>The committee meets during the Area 75 Winter Service Assembly, Delegate's Workshop, Summer Service Assembly, and Fall Pre-Conference Service Assembly, as well as Saturday afternoon following the Area 75 Conference Assembly.</p>
      <p><strong>We are not a glum lot!</strong> Join us — being a GvR is a great way for you or your sponsees to enter service work.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
      <h2>Monthly Newsletter</h2>
      <p>New to Area 75 is our monthly Grapevine/LaViña Committee Newsletter — featuring event listings, Grapevine news, story submission topics and due dates, a featured book, and a bit of trivia.</p>
      <a href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1KI26v198FoalKxT1_v1VKNFccibzxCLD?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary">📰 View Newsletters →</a>
    </div>

